WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.501
-Guys, it's time for "Tonight Show" Hashtags.

00:00:02.501 --> 00:00:03.667
Here we go.

00:00:03.667 --> 00:00:05.467
-♪ Hashtags ♪

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:10.067
♪ Hashtags ♪

00:00:11.767 --> 00:00:14.934
-We do this thing every week where I send out a hashtag

00:00:14.934 --> 00:00:17.267
and I ask you guys to respond to that topic.

00:00:17.267 --> 00:00:20.334
This week I sent out the hashtag "Pet Costumes,"

00:00:20.334 --> 00:00:21.767
and I asked you to tweet out your cutest,

00:00:21.767 --> 00:00:23.167
funniest pet costumes.

00:00:23.167 --> 00:00:25.300
Within minutes, it was a trending topic in the US,

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:27.334
so thank you for playing along.

00:00:27.334 --> 00:00:28.601
Now I thought I'd share

00:00:28.601 --> 00:00:31.367
some of my favorite pet costumes from you guys.

00:00:31.367 --> 00:00:34.567
Here we go. This first one is from @sbrabston.

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:36.834
She shared a photo of the Blues Brothers.

00:00:36.834 --> 00:00:38.968
Look at these guys. Yeah. Not bad.

00:00:38.968 --> 00:00:41.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:42.634
They're really cute.

00:00:42.634 --> 00:00:45.167
This one's from @aweis07.

00:00:45.167 --> 00:00:48.734
She shared a photo of Snoopy with Charlie Brown.

00:00:48.734 --> 00:00:50.834
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:50.834 --> 00:00:53.133
Look at the baby. -Aww, look at Charlie Brown.

00:00:53.133 --> 00:00:54.534
Cute little baby.

00:00:54.534 --> 00:00:58.200
This one is from @NotPurfect-- -Ooh.

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:01.434
-"P-U-R." -Oh, like the cat.

00:01:01.434 --> 00:01:02.667
-Oh, yeah. -[ Imitates purring ]

00:01:02.667 --> 00:01:04.701
-@NotPurfect07. -I want it to be a cat photo.

00:01:04.701 --> 00:01:08.133
-She shared a photo of a literal Chia Pet.

00:01:08.133 --> 00:01:09.133
-Oh.

00:01:09.133 --> 00:01:11.167
[ Applause ]

00:01:11.167 --> 00:01:12.601
-Brilliant.

00:01:12.601 --> 00:01:14.801
That's a great idea. -Yeah.

00:01:14.801 --> 00:01:18.100
-This one is from @SayItDontSpayIt.

00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:19.667
-Oh, wow. Okay.

00:01:19.667 --> 00:01:22.801
-He shared a photo of a scene from the movie "It."

00:01:22.801 --> 00:01:24.801
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:01:26.501 --> 00:01:28.634
-Oh, my God. -Oh, my God.

00:01:28.634 --> 00:01:29.801
-You know how long that would have taken

00:01:29.801 --> 00:01:31.434
to put all that together?

00:01:31.434 --> 00:01:35.200
-That's like a week and a half. -That's a day-and-a-half shoot.

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:37.167
-"Stay there, stay there. Stay, stay, stay, stay, stay."

00:01:37.167 --> 00:01:39.767
-It's not even Halloween. -Yeah.

00:01:39.767 --> 00:01:41.067
-Pretty great, though.

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:43.701
This one is from @krisflyau.

00:01:43.701 --> 00:01:47.067
She shared a photo of her Boxer as a boxer.

00:01:47.067 --> 00:01:49.300
-Aww! [ Applause ]

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:50.467
Meta.

00:01:51.767 --> 00:01:54.434
This one's from @syd dumb.

00:01:54.434 --> 00:01:58.100
They shared a photo of their breakfast.

00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:00.400
[ Applause ]

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:01.701
I guess use the cone.

00:02:01.701 --> 00:02:04.567
-He probably had surgeries, got spayed.

00:02:04.567 --> 00:02:08.834
-This one's from @SUNshyzzle.

00:02:08.834 --> 00:02:11.367
She shared a photo of a rare Beanie Baby.

00:02:11.367 --> 00:02:14.434
Ooh. [ Applause ]

00:02:14.434 --> 00:02:17.534
-Just use a tag. These are good ideas.

00:02:17.534 --> 00:02:22.133
This one's from @NahTunaKerr.

00:02:22.133 --> 00:02:23.968
-"NahTunaKerr." -NahTunaKerr.

00:02:23.968 --> 00:02:25.234
NahTunaKerr?

00:02:25.234 --> 00:02:27.033
-Not tuna... -Nah...

00:02:27.033 --> 00:02:28.634
-"Nah, tuna care."

00:02:28.634 --> 00:02:30.801
-Yeah. "Nah, tuna care." -Yeah.

00:02:30.801 --> 00:02:31.801
-I guess so.

00:02:31.801 --> 00:02:33.400
-Or maybe they care about tuna.

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:35.801
-"NahTuna-- NahTunaKerr."

00:02:35.801 --> 00:02:37.501
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.501 --> 00:02:38.534
I know I'm missing something.

00:02:38.534 --> 00:02:40.934
I just don't know what I'm missing.

00:02:40.934 --> 00:02:43.100
They shared a photo of their favorite fruit.

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:45.434
Aww, that dog looks miserable.

00:02:45.434 --> 00:02:48.133
[ Applause ]

00:02:48.133 --> 00:02:49.667
[ Laughing ] That dog. That dog is so mad.

00:02:49.667 --> 00:02:51.000
-Oh, my God.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:52.701
What am I doing? What am I doing?

00:02:52.701 --> 00:02:55.801
This last one is from @iceicecoldbrrr.

00:02:55.801 --> 00:02:59.234
They shared a photo of their favorite Miley music video.

00:02:59.234 --> 00:03:01.133
There you have it, "Wrecking Ball."

00:03:01.133 --> 00:03:02.167
[ Applause ] [ Laughs ]

00:03:02.167 --> 00:03:03.167
There you have it.

00:03:03.167 --> 00:03:04.200
Those are "Tonight Show" hashtags.

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:05.901
To check out more of our favorites,

00:03:05.901 --> 00:03:08.801
